@startuml
' Define components
package "LocAi" {
  [Server] as server <<Component>>
  [RAG Manager] as rag <<Component>>
  [Model Router] as modelRouter <<Component>>
  [CLI] as cli <<Component>>
  [GUI] as gui <<Component>>
  [Launcher] as launcher <<Component>>
}

' Relationships
server --> modelRouter : uses
server --> rag : utilizes
cli --> modelRouter : calls
cli --> server : calls API
gui --> server : calls API
launcher --> gui : launches
launcher --> server : starts

@enduml
